OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly sunny spells in the east
OL,6,Fgiving way to cloud and rain or
OL,7,Fshowers moving southeast, but this
OL,8,Fclearing during the afternoon.
OL,9,FBecoming dry and bright with sunny
OL,10,Fspells later. Warm, perhaps very warm
OL,11,Fin Kent. Breezy on Kent coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FEarly evening sunny spells
OL,14,Fgiving way to wet conditions later in
OL,15,Fthe evening. Rain, occasionally heavy,
OL,16,Fmoving southeastwards overnight.
OL,17,FOccasionally breezy on coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
