OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, clearing away late morning to
OL,7,Fearly afternoon. Then mostly dry with
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Breezy.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,11,Fspells and isolated showers Wednesday,
OL,12,Fwind easing. Mostly dry Thursday, with
OL,13,Fhazy sunshine. Early rain and breeze
OL,14,FFriday clearing later. Temperatures
OL,15,Faround average for early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
